/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By introducing human skin equivalent \(HSE\) models to test the impact of ingredients on the scalp microbiome, a more comprehensive assessment of said ingredients can take place. From a financial perspective, R&D costs are dramatically reduced with a HSE model, as clinical trial participant numbers can be halved. [36] All while bringing new products to market that meet safety, regulatory, and efficacy standards at a much faster rate. [37])
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [19]
>>
